<!doctype html><html lang="ko"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>HOMSelf 매니저 관리</title><link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com"><link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin><link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Jua&display=swap" rel="stylesheet"><link rel="stylesheet" href="/public/admin_manage.css"><link rel="stylesheet" href="/public/admin_nav.css"></head><body><header class="manage-topbar"><a href="/main">HOMSelf</a><h1>매니저 관리</h1><form id="login" class="manage-login"><input id="token" type="password" inputmode="numeric" pattern="[0-9]{4}" maxlength="4" placeholder="관리자 PIN" autocomplete="off" required><button>열기</button><button type="button" id="logout">로그아웃</button></form></header><main class="manage-shell"><section id="lock" class="manage-lock">관리자 PIN 인증 후 매니저 관리 화면을 볼 수 있습니다.</section><section id="content" class="manage-content" hidden><p id="status" class="manage-status"></p><input id="search" class="search" placeholder="매니저명 검색"><div id="list" class="manage-grid"></div></section></main><script src="/public/admin_nav.js"></script><script src="/public/managers_admin.js"></script></body></html>